{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37789","headline":"贺左省新除韦拾遗 · 郑谷","name":"贺左省新除韦拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初昇谏署是真仙，浪透桃花恰五年。\n垂白郎官居座末，着绯人吏立阶前。\n百寮班列趋丹陛，两掖风清上碧天。\n从此追飞何处去，金銮殿与玉堂连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}